// A module-scope `return` used to be silently accepted: both VMs treated
// it as "end of module" (rc=0, main never ran) and the C backend
// generated uncompilable C (`return frame[...]` from an int function)
// (audit §4.5).
// EXPECT-ERROR: return outside of a function
return 5
fn main() {
    print(1)
}
